OL,3,ARussia and Ukraine say emergency alert
OL,4,Aapps were hit by apparent cyber-attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia and Ukraine say their emergency
OL,7,Fwarning apps have been hit by apparent
OL,8,Fcyber-attacks, causing alarming false
OL,9,Fwarnings to be sent
OL,11,FMoscow says a "massive cyber-attack"
OL,12,Fhas affected its app but insists its
OL,13,Fwider alert system is "operating as
OL,14,Fnormal". A Ukrainian espionage group
OL,15,Fclaims the messages included fake
OL,16,Fwarnings of nuclear strikes inside
OL,17,FRussia
OL,19,FThis comes shortly after Ukraine's air
OL,20,Fraid warning app sent out false
OL,21,Fwarnings of a radiation threat in Kyiv,
OL,22,Ffollowing an apparent hack
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
